        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the security of this old Chinese barracks apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty begins on the first floor. Patrol each level carefully, one by one, until you reach the ninth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember</strong>: Always move forward, and walk to the end of the hallway. Keep your eyes open. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight to check every corner, even the slightest anomalies could be a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice anything unusual, turn back immediately! </strong>Ignore it, and the loop will begin again. You’ll find yourself back where you started， and you may never escape this building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only things you can rely on are your eyes, your memory, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert, and begin your patrol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Security Operations Manual]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[W/A/S/D]</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Mouse]</strong>: Control view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[E]</strong>: Toggle Flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[F]</strong>: Snap fingers (Activates the voice-controlled hallway lights)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrol Rules:</strong> Observe the hallway carefully.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Anomaly</strong>: Walk straight through, <strong>go up</strong> to the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Detected</strong>: Turn back immediately, <strong>go up</strong> to the next floor.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the security of this old Chinese barracks apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty begins on the first floor. Patrol each level carefully, one by one, until you reach the ninth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember</strong>: Always move forward, and walk to the end of the hallway. Keep your eyes open. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight to check every corner, even the slightest anomalies could be a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice anything unusual, turn back immediately! </strong>Ignore it, and the loop will begin again. You’ll find yourself back where you started， and you may never escape this building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only things you can rely on are your eyes, your memory, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert, and begin your patrol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Security Operations Manual]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[W/A/S/D]</strong>: Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Mouse]</strong>: Control view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[E]</strong>: Toggle Flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[F]</strong>: Snap fingers (Activates the voice-controlled hallway lights)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrol Rules:</strong> Observe the hallway carefully.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Anomaly</strong>: Walk straight through, <strong>go up</strong> to the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Detected</strong>: Turn back immediately, <strong>go up</strong> to the next floor.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "You patrol an abandoned Chinese apartment where time loops endlessly. Watch closely, find anomalies on every floor. If you ignore them, you will never escape this building.",
